          "type": "TCHAR*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Visitor",
          "type": "IPlatformFile::FDirectoryVisitor&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Call the Visit function of the visitor once for each file or directory in a directory tree. This function explores subdirectories.\n@param Directory\t\tThe directory to iterate the contents of, recursively.\n@param Visitor\t\tVisitor to call for each element of the directory and each element of all subdirectories.\n@return\t\t\t\tfalse if the directory did not exist or if the visitor returned false."
    },
